  "description": "Available in Grey and Wicked Blue\n4130 Chromoly frame with modern trail Geometry and a 100mm adjustable air front suspension fork\nShimano's 1x10 drivetrain with Deore Clutch Derailleur, 11-42 cassette, and narrow-wide chainring\nHydraulic Disc Brakes with 160mm Rotors Front and Rear\nTubeless Compatible rims and Grippy Tubeless Ready 2.25mm tires\nPut simply - the Scout has everything we want in a Modern Mountain Bike. We designed it to climb technical single track, hold a line on high-speed descents, rip your local pump track or dirt jumps while putting a smile on your kid's face!\nIt's a fun, durable, ride-anywhere bike. When your son or daughter is ready to ride further, the Scout's ready to lead.\n\nFrame\n\nCleary Scout Trail Frame\nButted 4130 Chromoly tubing, disc brake equipped, down tube cable routing, 44mm head tube, down tube bottle bosses\n\nFork\nSuntour XCR LO 26 air fork, 100mm travel, lock out.\n\nHandlebar\nCleary Oversize Aluminum 31.8mm Handlebar 15mm Rise, 680mm Width.\n\nStem\nCleary Oversize Aluminum 31.8mm Stem 50mm Length\n\nHeadset\nFSA integrated 1 1/8th, Sealed.\n\nCrankset\nCleary forged 2 piece crankset 165mm, external bearing bottom bracket, replaceable alloy narrow wide 28t chainring\n\nPedals\nVP junior, plastic body with ball bearings and 9/16\"axle\n\nCassette\nSunrace 11-42 Tooth 10 Speed wide range\n\nRims\nAlex DP21 26\" double wall, tubeless ready, 28hole\n\nHub (Rear)\nJoytech sealed 6-bolt QR 9/10 speed cassette hub\n\nTires\nVee Tire Co Crown Gem 26\" X 2.25\" tubeless ready folding bead, Schrader valve tubes",
